ion with GPT image models, text-to-speech, and tracing/observability via OpenTelemetry and the VS Code AI Toolkit. The app also demonstrates LLM-as-a-judge evaluation, content guardrails, and how to connect local agents to Azure AI Foundry. The full source is available as an open-source Azure Samples repo.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Bjm8zMpMmvQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-05T16:07:35.000Z"},{"id":"1kcFYKQjM","title":"SQL Server Database Migration using Azure Arc Explained | Data Exposed: MVP Edition","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-tQFKpLPH_U","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sql-server-database-migration-using-azure-arc-explained-data-exposed-mvp-edition-1kcfykqjm","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-tQFKpLPH_U/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-04T16:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"WnzTrE7ZN","title":"SXSW Tip #4 - Guide to a Standing Beacon","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nRyj0kCi7GI","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sxsw-tip-4---guide-to-a-standing-beacon-wnztre7zn","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nRyj0kCi7GI/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T15:58:21.000Z"},{"id":"w7uq5elyY","title":"SXSW Tip #4 - Guide to a Standing Beacon","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L6tilxumVFE","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sxsw-tip-4---guide-to-a-standing-beacon-w7uq5elyy","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L6tilxumVFE/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T15:57:35.000Z"},{"id":"2x8brqz1c","title":"Keynote Interview: AMD's Steve Berg on the Hardware Behind Cosmos DB | Azure Cosmos DB Conf 2026","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eL-Wj27FHmM","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/keynote-interview-amd-s-steve-berg-on-the-hardware-behind-cosmos-db-azure-cosmos-db-conf-2026-2x8brqz1c","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eL-Wj27FHmM/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T14:38:28.000Z"},{"id":"MSwDbRrY7","title":"Azure Cosmos DB Conf 2026 Keynote","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lOppojg4QlY","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/azure-cosmos-db-conf-2026-keynote-mswdbrry7","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lOppojg4QlY/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T14:37:16.000Z"},{"id":"hA3MC05wW","title":"How Azure Cosmos DB Runs Under the Hood | Andrew Liu | Azure Cosmos DB Conf 2026","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A7Q_wZqUmJc","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-azure-cosmos-db-runs-under-the-hood-andrew-liu-azure-cosmos-db-conf-2026-ha3mc05ww","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A7Q_wZqUmJc/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T14:32:27.000Z"},{"id":"DYUHrbnqv","title":"Microsoft SQL Drivers and SDKs: Python, AI, Bulk Copy, Arrow & more! | Data Exposed","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A5PtIIlVsYI","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/microsoft-sql-drivers-and-sdks-python-ai-bulk-copy-arrow-more-data-exposed-dyuhrbnqv","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A5PtIIlVsYI/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T16:00:17.000Z"},{"id":"lvv7pc9P0","title":"SXSW Tip #3 - Keep a Clean Molt","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OqV7Gsm02Ro","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sxsw-tip-3---keep-a-clean-molt-lvv7pc9p0","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OqV7Gsm02Ro/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-29T17:26:22.000Z"},{"id":"iCss1R5pX","title":"SXSW Tip #3 - Keep a Clean Molt","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mWRDwzal7eI","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sxsw-tip-3---keep-a-clean-molt-icss1r5px","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mWRDwzal7eI/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-29T17:25:38.000Z"}],"top_posts":[{"id":"bvLceJFPL","title":"SQL Server 2025: The AI-ready enterprise database platform | Data Exposed","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3RgncKX6K9A","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sql-server-2025-the-ai-ready-enterprise-database-platform-data-exposed-bvlcejfpl","summary":"SQL Server 2025 is now in public preview, positioning itself as an AI-ready enterprise database platform. Key features include built-in AI capabilities with vector search, native JSON support, regular expression functions in T-SQL, and change event streaming. The release emphasizes security and isolation by keeping AI models outside the SQL engine while providing T-SQL interfaces for vector operations. Developer improvements include new JSON data types, REST endpoint connectivity, and separate developer editions for standard and enterprise testing. The platform integrates with Microsoft Fabric for unified data experiences and maintains focus on traditional database strengths like performance, security, and availability with over 40 new engine features.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3RgncKX6K9A/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-05T16:00:04.000Z"},{"id":"7HLprIolh","title":"Content Creation: Using Stability AI's Visual Models for Marketing | DEM531","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kp-xVh4pmss","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/content-creation-using-stability-ai-s-visual-models-for-marketing-dem531-7hlpriolh","summary":"The session details how Azure AI Foundry utilizes Stability AI's models to facilitate innovative content creation and marketing. It highlights models such as Stable Diffusion, SDG3.5, and Stable Image Ultra for efficient image generation and customization. The models are designed for scale and realistic imagery, with applications in e-commerce, advertising, and design domains. Safety features are integrated to ensure compliance and prompt adherence while enabling businesses to generate tailored images rapidly.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kp-xVh4pmss/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-23T15:39:48.000Z"},{"id":"pdo4f50yW","title":"SQL Server 2025: Mirroring for SQL Server in Fabric | Data Exposed","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IXJwnv0zZuM","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sql-server-2025-mirroring-for-sql-server-in-fabric-data-exposed-pdo4f50yw","summary":"Copilot for SQL Server Management Studio (SSMS) is now in public preview, requiring an Azure OpenAI endpoint to get started. The tool integrates directly into SSMS as a dockable window, offering context-aware assistance for database queries and operations. Key features include natural language to SQL conversion, query explanation and fixing capabilities, and database-specific context switching. Users can ask general SQL questions or get help with specific database operations by selecting different contexts. The tool provides right-click options to document, explain, fix, or refactor queries. Microsoft is actively collecting feedback and exploring additional licensing options including GitHub Copilot integration, with plans for iterative updates leading to general availability.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IXJwnv0zZuM/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-17T16:00:36.000Z"},{"id":"4LEepi61z","title":"Build modern data applications with SQL Server 2025 | Data Exposed","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pckjd-5rT9M","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/build-modern-data-applications-with-sql-server-2025-data-exposed-4leepi61z","summary":"SQL Server 2025 introduces significant developer enhancements including native JSON data type with binary storage optimization, comprehensive regex support with POSIX standard compliance, fuzzy string matching algorithms, and various T-SQL improvements. The native JSON type supports documents up to 2GB with in-place modifications and indexing capabilities. Regex functionality includes five intrinsic functions and two table-valued functions for pattern matching, validation, and data manipulation. Additional features include fuzzy string matching using Levenshtein and Jaro-Winkler algorithms, Unicode character support, concatenation operators, enhanced date functions, and new aggregate functions like PRODUCT.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pckjd-5rT9M/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-12T16:01:24.000Z"},{"id":"jByLYW4Y7","title":"SQL Server 2025: Mirroring for SQL Server in Fabric | Data Exposed","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BtE1t9E--zo","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sql-server-2025-mirroring-for-sql-server-in-fabric-data-exposed-jbylyw4y7","summary":"Microsoft has released SQL Server mirroring in public preview, enabling real-time data replication from SQL Server databases to Microsoft Fabric's OneLake for analytics. The feature supports both existing SQL Server versions (using CDC technology) and SQL Server 2025 (using improved change feed technology). SQL Server 2025 offers enhanced capabilities including managed identity support through Azure Arc, push-based data movement, and better performance without CDC limitations. The mirroring process creates analytics-ready data in delta format, allowing users to query across multiple data sources and leverage Fabric's full ecosystem including Power BI and AI services.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BtE1t9E--zo/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-03T16:00:21.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["ailabs-393","davidbombal","fknight","nicbarkeragain","devtoolsfm"],"opposite_handles":["horde","dailydevworld","watercooler","on_leuwcq","dotnetsquad"],"similar":[{"id":"ailabs-393","handle":"ailabs-393","name":"AI LABS","is_squad":false,"x":-4.0328,"y":-9.3234,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":79,"image":"https://